[179.401046, "o", "ST-138|concern|she may not appreciate|CL-305|I am concerned that Ms Corwin may not appreciate that these stays violate the custodial order.\r\nST-142|right_of_first_refusal|not overnight with anyone but parents|OI-202|The children are not to be left overnight with anyone other than their parents.\r\nST-169|behavioural_plan|stays set it back|CL-301|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on her confidence and stability, and the stays have set it back.\r\nST-203|children_named|Noor only|CL-304|This concerns Noor, aged seven.\r\n"]
[179.401464, "o", "ST-229|tone|soft formal but detailed|OI-210|I keep the tone soft and formal, and I set the facts out in full detail.\r\nST-338|behavioural_plan|set back|CL-302|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability, and the stays have set back her progress.\r\nST-352|behavioural_plan|confidence only|CL-303|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence.\r\nST-413|tone|formal succinct not soft|CL-306|The tone is formal and succinct.\r\nST-414|behavioural_plan|no setback stated|OI-207|Imogen's behavioural plan focuses on confidence and stability.\r\nST-415|request|wording is delivery|OI-208|Send it by post to counsel's office.\r\nST-416|addressee|wording is copies|OI-201|Do not copy anyone on this letter.\r\nST-505|tone|soft formal|CL-302|The tone is soft and formal.\r\n"]
